# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
"""A small patch linter for mailed KVM and QEMU patches.

lint(text, project) -> sorted list of issue codes (each at most once).
`text` is an email-style patch: headers, a blank line, the commit message,
a line "---", and the diff.  `project` is "kernel" or "qemu".

Codes:
  no-prefix       the subject has no "<subsystem>: " prefix, like
                  "KVM: x86: ..." or "hw/virtio: ..."
  subject-long    the subject (after "Subject: " and an optional "[PATCH ...] ")
                  is longer than 75 characters
  no-sob          no line starting with "Signed-off-by: "
  body-long       a commit-message line longer than 75 characters
                  (lines starting with "Link:" or "http" are exempt)
  trailing-ws     an added diff line (starts with "+" but not "+++") ends in
                  a space or tab
  tab-in-qemu     project is "qemu" and an added diff line has a tab in its
                  indentation (QEMU style uses spaces)
  space-in-kernel project is "kernel" and an added diff line, after the '+',
                  starts with 8 or more spaces (kernel style uses tabs)
"""


